<title>USA: Deutsche Bank AG unit sets $1.1 bln in debt.</title>
<headline>Deutsche Bank AG unit sets $1.1 bln in debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Deutsche Bank AG unit, Deutsche Bank Financial Inc, priced on Tuesday, according to lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p>The initial $1.0 billion size of the offering was increased to meet investor demand, the lead manager said.</p>
<p>BORROWER: DEUTSCHE BANK FINANCIAL INC</p>
<p>AMT $1.1 BLN	 COUPON 6.70	 MATURITY  12/13/06</p>
<p>TYPE SUB NOTES     ISS PRICE 99.691  FIRST PAY DATE</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S AA1   YIELD  6.743	PAY FREQ SEMI</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P  AA-PLUS  SPREAD 54 BPS     CALLABLE NO</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1675</p>
